## Tutorial Mission

tutorial-title = Tutorial
tutorial-briefing = Welcome to Dune 2000! This tutorial will teach you the basics of commanding your forces on Arrakis.
tutorial-complete-objective = Complete the tutorial

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 1: Camera Movement
tutorial-welcome = Welcome to Arrakis, Commander!
tutorial-camera-scroll = Use the ARROW KEYS to scroll around the map.
tutorial-camera-home = Press H to quickly jump back to your base.
tutorial-camera-complete = Good! You've learned to navigate the battlefield.
tutorial-mission-text-camera = Scroll around with Arrow Keys, then press H

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 2: Unit Selection
tutorial-select-intro = Now let's learn to select units.
tutorial-select-click = LEFT-CLICK on a unit to select it.
tutorial-select-drag = CLICK and DRAG to select multiple units.
tutorial-select-complete = Excellent! You can now select your troops.
tutorial-mission-text-select = Select your Light Infantry units

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 3: Unit Movement
tutorial-move-intro = With units selected, RIGHT-CLICK to move them.
tutorial-move-practice = Try moving your infantry around the battlefield.
tutorial-move-complete = Well done! Your units followed orders.
tutorial-mission-text-move = Move your units by right-clicking on the ground

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 4: Control Groups
tutorial-control-intro = Control groups let you quickly select units.
tutorial-control-create = Select units, then press CTRL+1 to assign group 1.
tutorial-control-select = Press 1 to reselect that group anytime!
tutorial-control-complete = Control groups will be essential in battle.
tutorial-mission-text-control = Create control group 1 with your infantry (Ctrl+1)

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 5: Deploy MCV
tutorial-mcv-intro = Your MCV (Mobile Construction Vehicle) is your mobile base.
tutorial-mcv-deploy = Select the MCV and RIGHT-CLICK it to deploy.
tutorial-mcv-creates = This creates your Construction Yard!
tutorial-mcv-complete = Your Construction Yard is ready!
tutorial-mission-text-mcv = Deploy your MCV (select it, then right-click it)

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 6: Place Concrete
tutorial-concrete-intro = Before building structures, you should lay concrete foundations.
tutorial-concrete-protect = Concrete protects buildings from damage during construction.
tutorial-concrete-click = Click the Concrete Slab icon in the sidebar.
tutorial-concrete-place = Place some concrete slabs near your Construction Yard.
tutorial-concrete-complete = Good! Concrete foundations are in place.
tutorial-mission-text-concrete = Place Concrete Slabs near your base

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 7: Build Wind Trap
tutorial-power-intro = Now let's build a Wind Trap for power.
tutorial-power-click = Click the Wind Trap icon in the sidebar.
tutorial-power-place = Place it on your concrete foundation for best results.
tutorial-power-complete = Power is flowing to your base!
tutorial-mission-text-power = Build a Wind Trap on concrete

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 8: Build Refinery
tutorial-refinery-intro = Wind Traps provide power for your base.
tutorial-refinery-build = Now build a Refinery to collect Spice!
tutorial-refinery-spice = Spice is the source of all credits on Arrakis.
tutorial-refinery-complete = Your Refinery is operational!
tutorial-mission-text-refinery = Build a Refinery

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 9: Harvesting
tutorial-harvest-intro = Your Harvester will automatically collect Spice.
tutorial-harvest-fields = The orange Spice fields are your source of income.
tutorial-harvest-wait = Wait for your Harvester to deliver a load of Spice.
tutorial-harvest-complete = Credits are flowing in! You can now build more.
tutorial-mission-text-harvest = Wait for Harvester to collect Spice

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 10: Build Barracks
tutorial-barracks-intro = To train soldiers, you need a Barracks.
tutorial-barracks-build = Build a Barracks from the sidebar.
tutorial-barracks-complete = Your Barracks is ready to train infantry!
tutorial-mission-text-barracks = Build a Barracks

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 11: Train Infantry
tutorial-infantry-click = Click the Light Infantry icon to start training.
tutorial-infantry-train = Train at least 4 Light Infantry soldiers.
tutorial-infantry-complete = Your squad is growing stronger!
tutorial-mission-text-infantry = Train 4 Light Infantry

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 12: Build Light Factory
tutorial-factory-intro = Infantry alone won't win battles.
tutorial-factory-build = Build a Light Factory for vehicles!
tutorial-factory-complete = Vehicle production is now available!
tutorial-mission-text-factory = Build a Light Factory

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 13: Build Vehicles
tutorial-vehicle-intro = Trikes are fast scout vehicles.
tutorial-vehicle-build = Build at least 3 Trikes for your army.
tutorial-vehicle-complete = Your mechanized force is ready!
tutorial-mission-text-vehicle = Build 3 Trikes

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 14: Combat
tutorial-combat-ready = Your army is ready, Commander!
tutorial-combat-enemy = The Harkonnen have a base to the southeast.
tutorial-combat-select = Select your combat units and attack!
tutorial-combat-attack = Right-click on enemies to attack them.
tutorial-combat-complete = The Harkonnen forces have been destroyed!
tutorial-mission-text-combat = Destroy the Harkonnen forces!

## Tutorial Messages - Objective 15: Victory
tutorial-victory = VICTORY! You have completed the tutorial!
tutorial-victory-basics = You now know the basics of Dune 2000.
tutorial-victory-next = Try a Skirmish or Campaign mission next!
tutorial-mission-text-victory = Tutorial Complete!
